@host = https://localhost:7093

### 1. Register
POST {{host}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ali",
  "lastName": "triki",
  "username": "userali",
  "email": "ali@gmail.com",
  "password": "Ali_triki2023"
}

### 2. Login
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/Auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ali@gmail.com",
  "password": "Ali_triki2023"
}

### 3. Add role admin
POST {{host}}/api/Auth/addrole
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "854b303f-bdaf-4ede-a088-1faa506e9030",
  "role": "admin"
}

### 4. WeatherForecast sans token (401)
GET {{host}}/WeatherForecast

### 5. WeatherForecast avec token admin (200)
GET {{host}}/WeatherForecast
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}